<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - SGS-Thomson &quot;outperformer&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SGS-Thomson &quot;outperformer&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs initiated coverage of the Franco-Italian semiconductor group SGS-Thomson Microelectronics NV with a &quot;market outperformer&quot; rating on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The investment bank said it anticipates a dull short-term outlook will be overlooked in view of longer-term 20 percent plus eps growth.</p>
<p>--London Newsoom +44 171 542 4027</p>
